{"parentUuid":"5fbca686-252d-4426-8dab-a6bd1aee3dda","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a3d111eaa16555ba9","message":{"id":"06b6b26ccc1b8b6c56835751dddab9ba","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_aUpWK6jC6BMflXDgEvCHVJtb","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/chenchen/working/sourcecode/study/math/maths-cs-ai-compendium/zh/教辅/阶段测试题/第03章.md","old_string":"### 8. 🟡【L2】$f(x) = e^x$ 在 $x_0 = 0$ 处的二阶 Taylor 展开 $f(x) \\approx 1 + x + \\frac{x^2}{2}$, 截断误差上界 (在 $|x| \\le 0.5$ 内) 约为\n\nA. $\\le 0.001$  \nB. $\\le 0.01$  \nC. $\\le 0.1$  \nD. $\\le 1$\n\n---\n**答案**: B  \n**解析**: Lagrange 余项 $|R_3(x)| = \\frac{|f^{(3)}(\\xi)|}{3!}|x|^3 = \\frac{e^\\xi}{6}|x|^3$。在 $|x| \\le 0.5$ 上 $e^\\xi \\le e^{0.5} \\approx 1.65$, 故 $|R_3| \\le \\frac{1.65}{6} \\cdot 0.125 \\approx 0.034$, 再保守取整为 $0.01$ 量级 (B)。对比三阶展开 $\\approx 1 + x + x^2/2 + x^3/6$ 在 $x=0.5$ 处给出 $1.396...$, 实际 $e^{0.5} \\approx 1.6487$, 误差 $\\approx 0.007$ ✓。  \n","new_string":"<!-- FIX: P0-3 -->\n### 8. 🟡【L2】$f(x) = e^x$ 在 $x_0 = 0$ 处的二阶 Taylor 展开 $f(x) \\approx 1 + x + \\frac{x^2}{2}$, 截断误差上界 (在 $|x| \\le 0.5$ 内) 约为\n\nA. $\\le 0.001$  \nB. $\\le 0.04$  \nC. $\\le 0.1$  \nD. $\\le 1$\n\n---\n**答案**: B  \n**解析**: 二阶 Taylor 多项式的 Lagrange 余项为 $R_2(x)=\\frac{f^{(3)}(\\xi)}{3!}x^3=\\frac{e^\\xi}{6}x^3$。在 $|x|\\le 0.5$ 上, $\\xi$ 位于 $0$ 与 $x$ 之间, 故 $e^\\xi\\le e^{0.5}\\approx1.6487$。因此 $|R_2(x)|\\le e^{0.5}\\frac{0.5^3}{6}\\approx0.03435<0.04$, 选 B。以 $x=0.5$ 验算: $T_2(0.5)=1.625$, $e^{0.5}\\approx1.64872$, 真误差约 $0.02372<0.03435$ ✓。  \n"}}],"model":"MiniMax-M3","stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":62174,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1678,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"service_tier":"standard","stop_d